      (GlobalTheory.T.seeSaw_lastTwoSteps_value_fixedLevel_places D c v n G hc hv hG j h2.fst h2.snd.1 h2.snd.2).choose else 1, ?_, ?_⟩
  · intro j
    dsimp only
